<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36750" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plŭvĭa</span></b> , ae,
			f. (sc. aqua) [pluvius]. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Rain</i> (class.; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imber): pluvias metuo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 15, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tenues,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 1, 92</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in gens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 325</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a pluviā tueri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					3, 202</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de pluviis loqui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 4,
					87</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pluviarum signa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 1, 9, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui aufert stillas pluviae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Job, 36, 27</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a fall</i> or <i>shower</i> of any thing (post-class.; cf. pluo); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">of blossoms,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Nupt. Honor. 298</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pluvia ignea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Quaest. in Num. 4, 27</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Serm. 105,
			7</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>Rain-water</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">admixtā pluviā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					33, 6, 34, § 103</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
